src/vendor/iso-countries.json: ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 codes and their Wikidata items

src/vendor/iso-countries.json is derived from Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org/), read through the
Wikidata Query Service (https://query.wikidata.org/) on 2026-10-15 with the query

  SELECT ?code ?item ?itemLabel WHERE { ?item wdt:P297 ?code . FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?item wdt:P576 ?d }
    SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "en". } } ORDER BY ?code

by scripts/make-iso-countries.mjs, which keeps, for each code, the item that carries it as its ISO
3166-1 alpha-2 code (P297) and the item's English label, and nothing else. A code carried by two items
keeps the item with the lower number. The table is generated again only by that script.

Wikidata's structured data is released under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal public domain
dedication (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/; https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Wikidata:Licensing).
